s/steam/apps/1062110/extras/251eaf2db1dfccfccffd5b5cc5ce32a1.poster.avif?t=1709409664\" width=504 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1062110/extras/251eaf2db1dfccfccffd5b5cc5ce32a1.webm?t=1709409664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1062110/extras/251eaf2db1dfccfccffd5b5cc5ce32a1.mp4?t=1709409664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>HIGHLY REPLAYABLE + CO-OP</strong> - In addition to the main story UNSIGHTED also features additional challenge modes, BOSS RUSH and DUNGEON RAID. You can also bring a friend along your journey through Arcadia through full-featured CO-OP.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1062110/extras/4755f02701487ca67666e4ca0c747c2a.poster.avif?t=1709409664\" width=506 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1062110/extras/4755f02701487ca67666e4ca0c747c2a.webm?t=1709409664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1062110/extras/4755f02701487ca67666e4ca0c747c2a.mp4?t=1709409664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
      "short_description": "EXPLORE YOUR WAY. Awoken to a world ruined by war, Alma must traverse the vast city of Arcadia before the life force of her friends and herself withers away. Time is ticking, and every moment matters. Who will you save, and who will you leave to turn UNSIGHTED?",
